 "stop": "3 quatrains",
 "poem": "Howe'er the love resists,\nThe spirit of Love resides,\nTo inspire its youth to continue,\nTo bless it in eternity. Life\nIs not a march towards eternal\nFor one who is alone\nOr with the world weaned from strife alone.\nWe are the sun, and all unknown\nShould be at our side--at ago!\nWe are the moon that shines above us,\nAnd gives us the light of day! Again\nThe cold dark blood flushes",
